        {
          "insert": "What it is"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-55-kgr-25-10-3": {
      "id": "b-55-kgr-25-10-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A local mirror of SmashWiki at "
        },
        {
          "insert": "projects/melee/knowledge/sources/rag_search/smashwiki/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — roughly 1,600 pages with per-section retrieval, covering hitbox tables, frame data, and media. Corpus regime: raw text stored verbatim, nothing interpreted, so there is nothing to drift — only staleness versus upstream, which is tolerable."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-55-kgr-40ks-20-input-side": {
      "id": "b-55-kgr-40ks-20-input-side",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Now that the mirror sits among the knowledge stores, its input side is one upstream concern: the sync job refreshes the mirror from SmashWiki, and staleness versus upstream stays tolerable. There is no extraction pipeline to feed — the corpus is consumed by searching it."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-55-kgr-25-10-4": {
      "id": "b-55-kgr-25-10-4",
      "type": "callout",
      "props": {
        "title": "Stays file-based — no server component",
        "tone": "info"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Per the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "migration-map decision",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "10-system-design/55-knowledge-graph-redesign/70-migration-map"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ": nothing gets built for the smashwiki row. The corpus stays the file mirror searched by worker-side tooling — no server component, no index service. Raw text searched at need is the corpus regime working as designed."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-55-kgr-25-10-5": {
      "id": "b-55-kgr-25-10-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
